{'symbol': 'NRG', 'date': '2023-06-22 07:33:00', 'title': 'NRG PROVIDES STRATEGIC UPDATE AND ANNOUNCES NEW CAPITAL ALLOCATION FRAMEWORK AT 2023 INVESTOR DAY', 'text': "HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NRG ENERGY INC. (NYSE: NRG) (“NRG” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY WILL HOST A VIRTUAL INVESTOR DAY DURING WHICH MANAGEMENT WILL PROVIDE AN UPDATE ON ITS CONSUMER SERVICES STRATEGY, AS WELL AS THE COMPANY'S NEW CAPITAL ALLOCATION FRAMEWORK AND OPERATING EFFICIENCY INITIATIVES. “WE HAVE STRENGTHENED OUR CORE ENERGY BUSINESS WITH A LEADING SMART HOME TECHNOLOGY PLATFORM, POSITIONING NRG TO CAPITALIZE ON THE CONVERGENCE OF ELECTRICITY AND SMART TECHNOLOGIES INSIDE THE HOME,” SAID."}